2. assets/audio/ — TTS 打底语音 (617 个 WAV)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

这些文件由 tool/gen_audio.dart 调用 **macOS 内置的 `say` 命令**生成，
使用的是 Apple 随系统提供的语音。它们**不是本项目的原创作品**，其再分发
受 Apple 软件许可协议约束。

**若要在本仓库之外分发本应用，请先自行确认这一点**，或改用一套授权明确的
语音重新生成——`fvm dart run tool/gen_audio.dart` 会从内容包重建全部音频，
换 TTS 引擎只需改那个脚本。

家长在应用内录制的真人语音写入设备文档目录，不属于本仓库内容。

These files are generated by tool/gen_audio.dart via the **macOS built-in
`say` command**, using Apple's bundled system voices. They are NOT original
works of this project, and their redistribution is governed by Apple's
software license agreement.

**Verify this before distributing the app outside this repository**, or
regenerate the audio with a clearly-licensed voice set — running
`fvm dart run tool/gen_audio.dart` rebuilds every file from the content
packs, so swapping the TTS engine only means editing that one script.

Parent-recorded voice overrides live in the device's documents directory
and are not part of this repository.

